# Admin Frontend (Next.js)

App path: `apps/admin/` — independent git submodule (`qalam-admin`).

## Stack

Next.js 16 App Router · React 19 · TanStack Query/DB/Form/Table · Tailwind 4 · Radix UI

## API

- Base URL env: `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL` (e.g. `http://localhost:8080` or `62900`)
- All calls use `/Api/V1/Admin/...` and `/Api/V1/Education/...`
- Check `Response<T>` wrapper: `succeeded`, `data`, `message`

## Structure

```
apps/admin/
  app/              # App Router pages
  collections/      # TanStack DB API wrappers
  components/       # Shared UI
```

## Conventions

- Education CRUD follows hierarchy in `docs/Education-Management-CRUD.md`
- Use existing collection patterns in `collections/` for new admin resources
- Arabic-first RTL where the app already applies it
- Dev port: **3005** (`npm run dev`)

## Submodule workflow

Commit and push from `apps/admin/` to `qalam-admin` repo. Bump submodule pointer in monorepo when integrating:

```bash
cd apps/admin && git pull origin main && cd ../..
git add apps/admin && git commit -m "chore: bump admin submodule"
```

## Do not

- Change API route prefixes — backend uses `/Api/V1/`
- Hardcode education entity ids — use domain `code` and API-driven options
